Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.73,0:01:11.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村又到了美丽的星期天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:11.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another beautiful Sunday in Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.41,0:01:14.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天什么都毁不掉我的好心情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:14.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing can ruin my good mood today
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.73,0:01:19.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,无视他  无视他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ignoring, ignoring
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.95,0:01:44.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,口香糖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.95,0:01:44.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chewing gum?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.35,0:01:46.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:46.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.92,0:01:50.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:50.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.57,0:02:21.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乱扔垃圾的家伙真是烦死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.57,0:02:21.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,People that litter really bug me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾  烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Litter bugs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(822,920)}虫
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.67,0:02:25.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾虫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:25.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Litterbugs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.41,0:02:41.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:41.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Litter
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bugs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.29,0:02:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Litter
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.77,0:02:47.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾虫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:47.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Litterbugs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.69,0:02:48.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:48.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这口香糖是你丢的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,did you throw this gum away?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.22,0:02:51.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.22,0:02:51.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.60,0:02:53.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我要投诉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to complain
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.01,0:02:55.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你承认自己是个垃圾虫了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:55.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So you admit you're a litterbug
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.97,0:02:56.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:56.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did--
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.42,0:02:56.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:56.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.77,0:02:57.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.77,0:02:57.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没有  我刚只是踩到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, I just stepped in it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实  老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You sure did, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.60,0:03:03.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你恶心到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:03.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You disgust me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许这个可以教会你别把世界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe this will teach you not to treat the world
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.15,0:03:12.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当作你的私人垃圾桶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:12.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as your own personal trash can
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村警察局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Bikini Bottom P.D.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乱扔垃圾罚单
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Ticket for littering
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.17,0:03:19.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,处罚  社区服务
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:19.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Penalty: Community service"?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.45,0:03:24.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,傻子警察
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:24.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stupid policeman
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.80,0:03:26.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不是垃圾虫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:26.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm no litterbug
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没垃圾了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more trash
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.35,0:03:31.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我完事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:31.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm done
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.19,0:03:34.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  可以收我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.19,0:03:34.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here, you can have mine
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,事情还能变得更糟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:40.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can things get any worse?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然能了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:43.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course they can
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.65,0:03:46.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是章鱼威廉  我声乐班的死对头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:46.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squilliam Fancyson, my arch foe from band class
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.97,0:03:49.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没完没了地在做社区服务吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:49.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stuck doing community service, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.51,0:03:51.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是强制执行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:51.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Court-ordered?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.14,0:03:52.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:52.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.99,0:03:54.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在做志愿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.99,0:03:54.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm volunteering
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.55,0:03:54.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:54.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在打扫裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm cleaning up Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.27,0:04:00.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,将我的时间无私奉献给有意义的事业
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:04:00.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,selflessly devoting my time to a worthy cause
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.65,0:04:04.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怕是你把裤头村打扫干净
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:04.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe if you clean up Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.62,0:04:06.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就会有人给你立雕像了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:06.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they'll build a statue of you
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.19,0:04:07.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:07.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早就有人立过了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They've already built one
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的雕像
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.35,0:04:16.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只在一周之内就把裤头村清干净了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:16.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I cleaned up all of Bikini Bottom in only one week
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:16.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770,700)}章鱼威廉
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.15,0:04:18.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝福你  章鱼威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:18.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bless you, Squilliam Fancyson
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝福你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bless you
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.19,0:04:24.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一天就能把裤头村打扫干净
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:24.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll clean up Bikini Bottom in a day
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.25,0:04:26.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我来帮你一把吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:26.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me help you out
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.82,0:04:30.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:30.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就能帮你开个头了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:32.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That should get you started
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.85,0:04:34.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.85,0:04:34.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ta-ta
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.14,0:04:48.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼威廉自以为了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:48.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squilliam thinks he's so amazing
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.66,0:04:58.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得找个地方把这堆垃圾倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:58.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got to find somewhere to dump this litter
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.74,0:05:00.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:00.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.07,0:05:02.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,满了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:02.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Full
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.71,0:05:04.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全都满了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:04.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're all full
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.78,0:05:07.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要怎么运走这一大堆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:07.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna haul all this--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天就收垃圾吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is it trash day?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.55,0:05:24.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为星期二才收
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:24.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought it was Tuesday
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.42,0:05:24.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:24.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.82,0:05:26.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:26.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.55,0:05:29.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大伙儿  今天收垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:29.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody, it's trash day
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,收垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Trash day?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.86,0:05:32.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:32.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.32,0:05:33.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:33.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.85,0:05:35.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是收垃圾的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:35.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not the garbageman
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.23,0:05:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来帮你  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll help you, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.65,0:05:44.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么会在垃圾袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.65,0:05:44.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you in a trash bag?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.64,0:05:45.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想研究
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:45.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I wanted to study
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个蟹黄堡的完整生命周期
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the complete life cycle of a krabby patty
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,孤零零的  真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All alone, poor guy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.53,0:05:53.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你清垃圾  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:53.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could get rid of your trash, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用  谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我自己来就行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do it myself
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你让我帮一把吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please let me help
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.17,0:06:00.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:00.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.77,0:06:01.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:01.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.35,0:06:01.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.35,0:06:01.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.76,0:06:02.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:02.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty please?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.31,0:06:02.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免谈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:02.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托拜托求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pretty please with candy sprinkles on top?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen closely
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.15,0:06:09.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我用不着你来帮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:09.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.17,0:06:11.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宁愿被打成浆糊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:11.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would rather be beaten to a pulp
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.91,0:06:13.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是他  老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:13.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's him, mommy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.40,0:06:15.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是他偷了我的车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:15.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the man who stole my wagon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把他打成浆糊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beat him to a pulp
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.10,0:06:21.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小姐好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:21.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, lady
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.35,0:06:44.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在能帮你了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:44.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I help you now?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, fine
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.15,0:06:47.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可以来帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.15,0:06:47.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can help me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是要帮我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you gonna help me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.95,0:06:56.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得先闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:56.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First, close your eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.62,0:06:59.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:06:59.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.31,0:07:00.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:00.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不许偷看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No peeking
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.32,0:07:02.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:02.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你现在能睁开眼睛了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can open your eyes now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.97,0:07:10.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这也太傻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:10.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is so stu
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:11.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pid
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.73,0:07:13.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:13.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's gone
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.70,0:07:14.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你把垃圾放哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:14.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where did you put the trash?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都放到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I put it in--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.63,0:07:18.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:18.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Know what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.15,0:07:18.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不关我事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:18.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't care
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.99,0:07:20.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,反正垃圾没了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:20.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The trash is gone
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.62,0:07:22.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:22.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.15,0:07:24.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在有点没那么讨厌你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:24.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate you a little less now
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  那
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, that--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.66,0:07:27.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可真是一句好话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:27.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's a beautiful thing to say
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道你是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know how you did it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.42,0:07:36.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但还是谢谢你把垃圾都清干净了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:36.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but thanks for getting rid of all that trash
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.30,0:07:39.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很快就会有人给我立那座雕像了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:39.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They'll have that statue of me built in no time
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.40,0:08:25.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:25.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My house
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.57,0:08:28.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是你的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.57,0:08:28.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this yours?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:29.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.17,0:08:44.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总有几个谁学不到教训
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:44.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some people never learn
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:52.76,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(982,198)}我生气了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.27,0:08:55.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:55.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"I am angry"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.17,0:08:57.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你干嘛生气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:08:57.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, why are you angry?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.25,0:09:03.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:03.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.11,0:09:03.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.11,0:09:03.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.10,0:09:05.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:05.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's my house?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你垃圾顶上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,On top of your garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.57,0:09:11.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾场关门了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:11.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The dump was closed
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.85,0:09:16.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我都带这来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.85,0:09:16.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I brought it here
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.50,0:09:18.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:18.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,H-How?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.20,0:09:18.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:18.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like this
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.59,0:09:36.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要试试看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:36.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you want to try?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.85,0:09:41.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你嘴里吐出来的垃圾废话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:41.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of all the garbage that comes out of your mouth
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就数这个最不讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,this is the least annoying
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.87,0:10:00.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:00.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.34,0:10:00.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:00.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.68,0:10:01.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:01.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Zip it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have an idea
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.75,0:10:08.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:08.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.40,0:10:09.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,站进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:09.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stand in this
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见了  白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you, sucker
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.17,0:10:20.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是海绵宝宝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:20.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you SpongeBob SquarePants?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.57,0:10:22.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神王啊  不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:22.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neptune, no
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:24.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844,780)}海绵宝宝所有
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你很爱尽情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You get your kicks
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把垃圾倒别人的桶里是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out of putting trash in other people's bins, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本来会有人会给我立雕像的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:41.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They were gonna build a statue of me
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,雕像是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A statue, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.28,0:10:50.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:50.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.45,0:10:51.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.45,0:10:53.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:53.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.59,0:10:56.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你专属的雕像
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:56.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your very own statue
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.90,0:10:57.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:57.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.80,0:11:03.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:03.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.00,0:11:06.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是垃圾做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:06.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm made of garbage
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.07,0:11:07.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.07,0:11:07.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You sure are
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.35,0:11:11.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你做得好啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:11.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great job, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还生动形象刻画出了他的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You even captured his smell
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.77,0:11:16.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,失败味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:16.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The scent of failure
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.52,0:11:27.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我壮丽的雕像
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:27.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My glorious statue
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是你的雕像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:29.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is your statue?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.75,0:11:31.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原先是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:31.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:38.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:52.06,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,小蜗的玩伴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:54.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:54.52,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:56.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:56.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(387.575,418)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:56.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(507.742,672)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:06.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,836)}小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:06.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(818,198)}蜗牛粮
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.62,0:12:19.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:19.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, gare
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.75,0:12:21.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就不烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:21.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get out of your hair
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.25,0:12:26.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:26.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you later, gare
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想去散步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to go for a walk
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.62,0:12:30.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:30.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.49,0:12:32.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在没空散步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:32.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for a walk right now
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得去上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got to get over to the old job
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你只能自个待在家里了  小兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.58,0:12:37.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to stay here alone, little buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.85,0:12:38.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:38.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I promise
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.84,0:12:41.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一回家  就可以好好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:41.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as soon as I get home, we'll have fun
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.24,0:12:42.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:42.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Together
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.56,0:12:43.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:43.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.36,0:12:45.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爱你  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:45.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Love you, gare bear
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.87,0:12:47.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:47.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bye
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:52.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(558,642)}薯片
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Poor little snail
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是想玩一会儿而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just wanted some fun time
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.62,0:13:08.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现在只能想象得到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:08.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗现在的心里一定又煎熬又寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the tortured loneliness he must be feeling right now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:15.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,394)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the kru--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.73,0:13:21.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:21.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.77,0:13:24.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王明令严格禁止宠物进入
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:24.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but the Krusty Krab has a strict no-pet policy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.99,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(276,676)}严格禁止\N肮脏畜生\N进蟹堡王\N\N\N管理人员
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.87,0:13:27.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恐怕你家虫子只能在外面待着了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:27.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your worm will have to wait outside
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.59,0:13:29.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这我可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:29.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could never do that
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.25,0:13:32.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它落单就会孤单寂寞又难过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:32.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He gets far too lonely and upset when he's left alone
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.37,0:13:33.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.37,0:13:33.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.62,0:13:36.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来没法给你买你要的蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:36.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't buy you that krabby patty you wanted
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.60,0:13:38.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:38.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's just go home
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.63,0:13:42.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别急着走嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:42.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, why didn't you just say
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.65,0:13:46.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要给你家宠物买个蟹黄堡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.65,0:13:46.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you were buying your pet a krabby patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟你说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'll tell you what
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我补偿你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For your troubles
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.49,0:13:53.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原价卖给你两个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.49,0:13:53.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll give you two krabby patties at regular price
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.44,0:13:55.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:55.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.57,0:13:59.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给这位负责任的宠物主人两个蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:59.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,give this responsible pet owner two krabby patties
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,负责任的宠物主人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Responsible pet owner
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.49,0:14:04.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我每天都让小蜗自个待家里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:04.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I leave Gary home by himself every day
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.35,0:14:06.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得给小蜗打个电话  确保小蜗没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.35,0:14:06.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd better call him and make sure he's okay
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.57,0:14:11.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,心烦意乱到都不接电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:11.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too distraught to even answer the phone
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.49,0:14:13.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  你拨打的用户是海绵宝宝和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:13.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, you've reached SpongeBob and--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.30,0:14:15.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:15.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gary--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们两个玩得可开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The two of us are having too much fun together
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,目前没空接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to answer the phone right now
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,敬请留言  我们马上回电话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,so leave a message, and we'll call you right back
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.45,0:14:25.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前提是我们要暂停玩耍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:25.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if we ever get a break from having so much fun
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起休息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Together
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的对外留言全是谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My outgoing message is a lie
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, are you there?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.36,0:14:32.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  我是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.36,0:14:32.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, it's SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.42,0:14:33.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想确认下情况
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:33.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just checking in
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在的话就接一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:34.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you're there, pick up
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.00,0:14:37.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道你现在感觉很寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:37.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know you're feeling real lonely right now
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坚持住  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.80,0:14:40.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爸马上就回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:40.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Daddy'll be home soon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:42.23,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(664,306)}开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:43.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(664,306)}关
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.45,0:14:54.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚好路过  真是走运
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:54.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a stroke of luck, you coming by like this
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.96,0:14:57.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我正要重新给停船场涂沥青
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:57.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was just about to re-tar the parking lot
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.72,0:14:58.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你拿把铲子过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:14:58.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you grab a shovel?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我愿意给停船场重涂沥青
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I'd love to re-tar the parking lot
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我家里的蜗牛都已经觉得寂寞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I've got a lonely pet snail at home
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.82,0:15:07.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,何况严格来讲  我五小时前就下班了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:07.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and technically, my shift was over five hours ago
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.92,0:15:09.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不必多说  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:09.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Say no more, kid
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.82,0:15:13.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你回家去照顾你家宠物王八什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:13.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You get on home to your pet turtle or whatever
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.52,0:15:14.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:14.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right now
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.04,0:15:14.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:14.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.65,0:15:16.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你真放我走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:16.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll let me do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天早五个小时过来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:20.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just come in five hours early tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.16,0:15:21.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,涂完停船场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:21.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to finish the parking lot
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.27,0:15:23.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你最棒了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:23.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可怜的小蜗整天独自在家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Poor Gary's been home alone all day
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.94,0:15:28.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要怎么既让小蜗开心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.94,0:15:28.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna keep him happy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.77,0:15:31.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又能兼顾我在蟹堡王的责任呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:31.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and tend to my responsibilities at the Krusty Krab?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爸  我真能养着这只吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:34.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dad, is it really mine to keep?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.75,0:15:35.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.75,0:15:35.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.62,0:15:38.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你有了个毛茸茸的朋友就不会寂寞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you have a furry friend
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:38.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to keep you from feeling lonely
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.50,0:15:43.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下老爸可以问心无愧地出差去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:43.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And now daddy can go on his business trips guilt-free
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.92,0:15:47.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我给小蜗买个玩伴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:47.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mayhap if I got Gary a pal he could play with
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.65,0:15:49.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我上班期间  小蜗就不会寂寞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:49.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he won't be so lonely when I'm at work
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.67,0:15:51.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:51.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks, dad
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.11,0:15:54.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它们好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:54.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're so precious
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.93,0:15:57.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,买了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:15:57.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sold
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要买那边那只
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take that one right there
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.39,0:16:00.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想买下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:00.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You wish to obtain
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.87,0:16:03.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我既稀有又极度危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:03.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,one of my rare and extremely dangerous--
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.10,0:16:06.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  就这只
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:06.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, this is the one
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.02,0:16:07.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当心  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.02,0:16:07.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beware, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可不是普通的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:09.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary pet
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.82,0:16:11.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗一定会特开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:11.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary's gonna be so happy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.20,0:16:12.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请你务必明白
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:12.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You must understand
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些生物可能会十分不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,these creatures can be very unstable
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.75,0:16:17.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尤其是在其他宠物周边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:17.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,especially around other pets
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.08,0:16:21.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:21.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  再见
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,thanks, bye
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,何苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:25.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why bother?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.79,0:16:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没一个听话的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They never listen
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.25,0:16:29.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,警长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:29.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sheriff
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我捉来了你要找的银行抢匪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I nabbed your bank robber
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要的罪犯就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's your culprit right there
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.24,0:16:35.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快铐住他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:35.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now cuff him
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.67,0:16:37.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:37.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.97,0:16:41.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你买了个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:41.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought you a surprise
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你专属的玩伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your very own play pal
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它就叫做小蓬蓬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His name is puffy fluffy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我上班期间就让它来陪着你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and he'll keep you company while I'm at work
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个互相熟悉一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You two get to know each other
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.96,0:16:49.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很快就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:49.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.87,0:16:58.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:58.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat up, you two
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(890,764)}小蜗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.35,0:17:01.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.35,0:17:01.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.12,0:17:02.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么这么没有礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:02.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to your manners?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.75,0:17:04.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要乖一点  跟小蓬蓬分享
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:04.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You be nice and share with puffy fluffy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:05.42,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1210,932)}小蓬蓬
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come here, you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以了  蓬蓬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go, fluffy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now eat up
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.09,0:17:10.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去做点辣肉馅玉米卷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:10.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go make some enchiladas
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.59,0:17:20.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:20.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Done
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.47,0:17:24.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这辣肉馅玉米卷真是烫烫烫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:24.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These enchiladas are hot, hot, hot
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.69,0:17:27.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  无视新朋友可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:27.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Garold, it is not nice to ignore new friends
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.78,0:17:28.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们俩稍微玩一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:28.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you two play a little?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样就能建立感情了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That will help you bond
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下可好  我辣肉馅玉米卷凉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great, now my enchiladas are cold
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:39.41,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(200,912)}辣肉馅\N玉米卷
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.62,0:17:45.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你到底有什么毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.62,0:17:45.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, what has gotten into you, boy, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.29,0:17:47.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都怪你不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:47.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because you refuse
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最起码稍微尊重一下我们的新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to show the least bit of respect for our new friend
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还毁了我的辣肉馅玉米卷晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and because you have ruined my enchilada dinner
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.00,0:17:53.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:53.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have no choice
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让你今晚早点睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but to put you to siesta early tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.22,0:17:58.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望你满意了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.22,0:17:58.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hope you're happy now
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.28,0:17:59.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:17:59.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.68,0:18:01.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许你能把你那份满意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:01.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could extend that happiness
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.00,0:18:02.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扩散给你的新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:02.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to your new friend
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.82,0:18:05.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:05.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at you two
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.89,0:18:07.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在一起好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:07.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So cute together
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我接受你的道歉  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I accept your apology, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.52,0:18:11.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对它好一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:11.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, you be good to him
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.71,0:18:12.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:12.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今晚一定会睡得很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am gonna sleep so well
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.34,0:18:21.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟小蜗有个好玩伴陪着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,knowing that Gary's got a good buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:21.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to take care of him
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.29,0:18:26.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你不害臊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.29,0:18:26.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, shame on you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蓬蓬完完全全无害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Puffy fluffy is perfectly harmless
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看  它就在这睡得很香呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See, there he is, fast asleep
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能行行好让我好好睡  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, will you let me sleep, Gary, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.85,0:18:36.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:36.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good night
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.31,0:19:37.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在做肉丸吗  奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:37.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're making meatballs, grandma?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这么快就要吃晚餐了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time for dinner already?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.07,0:20:33.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得去检查下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:33.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better go check
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.75,0:20:35.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的小兄弟们相处得怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:35.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and see how my little buddies are getting along
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.55,0:20:39.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:39.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.48,0:20:41.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,昨晚一定是海震了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:41.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Must have been a seaquake last night
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.69,0:20:43.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又能咋办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:43.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.17,0:20:47.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有点不寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:47.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's unusual
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.63,0:20:48.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:48.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My library
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.76,0:20:52.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我珍贵的TS比目鱼回忆录
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:52.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And my prized memoirs of T.S. Halibut
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.68,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\pos(722,768)}TS{\fnAdobe 黑体 Std R}比目鱼回忆录
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:52.68,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 改自T.S.艾略特，英国诗人 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.27,0:20:54.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.27,0:20:54.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My clothes
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可不是随便什么海震
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This was no random seaquake
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.46,0:20:59.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会是谁干的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:59.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who could've done this?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.07,0:21:00.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里就只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.07,0:21:00.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There was no one here except for--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.30,0:21:01.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:01.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.86,0:21:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它肯定是嫉妒新朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I bet he's jealous about the new friend
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.02,0:21:04.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:04.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.97,0:21:06.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要惹上大麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:06.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are in big trouble, mister
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.17,0:21:08.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:08.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.06,0:21:09.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:09.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.60,0:21:11.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,立刻给我把这门的锁打开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:11.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unlock this door immediately
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.58,0:21:12.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:12.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.55,0:21:13.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  听见没
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.55,0:21:13.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, do you hear?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.81,0:21:17.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:17.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.59,0:21:20.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  你害我别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.59,0:21:20.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, Gary, you have left me no choice
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.93,0:21:26.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:26.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.87,0:21:30.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上把蓬蓬放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:30.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You put fluffy down right now
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.96,0:21:31.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不乖  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:31.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad boy, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.12,0:21:32.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:32.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.48,0:21:33.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:33.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.21,0:21:33.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.21,0:21:33.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad boy
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.77,0:21:34.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:34.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.56,0:21:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.27,0:21:35.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:35.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bad
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我早都跟你强调又强调
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have told you and told you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.44,0:21:38.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又强调又强调又强调又
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:38.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and told you and told you and told you and--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.97,0:21:39.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.97,0:21:39.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.48,0:21:40.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是蓬蓬朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:40.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you a friend of fluffy?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.90,0:21:42.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:42.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.62,0:21:45.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下疼起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:45.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, now this is starting to hurt
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.74,0:21:50.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就是我要说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:50.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what I was talking about--
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.15,0:22:14.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蓬蓬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.15,0:22:14.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fluffy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.27,0:22:16.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蓬蓬  别走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:16.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fluffy, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.07,0:22:17.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:17.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.29,0:22:19.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还要怎么狡辩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:19.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what do you have to say for yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.07,0:22:24.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这还差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:24.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is more like it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.77,0:22:27.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从现在起  我走到哪就带你到哪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.77,0:22:27.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm taking you wherever I go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.23,0:22:29.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也不留你独自在家了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:29.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more lonely days alone at home
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.80,0:22:34.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那只肮脏畜生在我厨房里干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:34.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that filthy animal doing in me kitchen?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.17,0:22:35.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.17,0:22:35.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.66,0:22:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我带了小蜗来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I brought Gary along to help out
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.02,0:22:40.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免费劳动力
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:40.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Free labor?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.81,0:22:43.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:43.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.87,0:22:45.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了  蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:45.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Serve them up, snail
